WEBVTT

00:00:57.162 --> 00:01:03.246
It's not just this sort of shallow feeling
of hope. Optimism is a search.

00:01:03.246 --> 00:01:08.746
It's a determination to look for a pathway
forward somewhere out there.

00:01:09.079 --> 00:01:15.038
I believe I truly believe there are
amazing people whose minds contain

00:01:15.246 --> 00:01:21.454
the ideas, the visions, the solutions that
can actually create that pathway

00:01:21.454 --> 00:01:24.704
forward. If given the support
and resources they need,

00:01:24.746 --> 00:01:28.913
they may very well light the path
out of this dark place we're in.

00:01:29.746 --> 00:01:35.996
So these are the people who can present
not optimism, but a case for optimism.